# A BLOCK SCALAR IN A PATTERN BLOCK — RE-AIMED AT [DD-13b.W23.1], and the
# direction changed. Until the grammar became two layers this file was
# REFUSED: format_design gave a block's `description` the full prose-value
# production, which includes `|`, while the lexical rules said a pattern
# block's lines are not indented, and the body's rule won.
#
# Under S1 there is ONE attachment rule everywhere and a prose region's
# extent is S3's, so the contradiction dissolves rather than being
# arbitrated (format_design §1.2.5, spec hunk SW16). The file is ACCEPTED
# and its `description` decodes to the region's own text — which is what
# the check asserts, because a three-way agreement on a VALUE catches more
# than one on a rejection.
#
# LEG A ONLY at this pin: legs B and C gain their attachment arm at W23.2.
pattern a+
description |
  this cannot work here
m "aaa" 0 3
